{"id":"vod_bf_36131","vodId":"36131","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"我的脑内恋碍选项","name_cn":"我的脑内恋碍选项","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第10集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-37/e044f76d569a82727a56f5dcc431378b.jpg"},"summary":"甘草奏（丰永利行 配音）拥有着极高的颜值，乍一看绝对是校园里校草级别的人物，然而，女生们对他的评价却是“有点恶心的变态”，这到底是怎么回事呢？原来，甘草奏有一个不为人知的的秘密，在他的大脑里经常会出现某些看上去不那么妙的选项，如果不执行这些选项，那么甘草奏的大脑就会产生惨无人道的剧痛，与此相比，执行选项后所获得的旁人怪异的眼光仿佛也没那么糟糕了。 某日，一位名叫裘可拉（佐土原香织 配音）的女生从天而降意外出现在了甘草奏的身边，这是甘草奏的大脑里第一次出现和美好沾边的选项。裘可拉的到来改变了甘草奏的生命，开启了他充满了爆笑的日常。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:33:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OVA","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/OVA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/wodenaoneilianaixuanxiang/第10集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:35.431Z"}